  "synopsis": "In the distant future, the region once known as Japan has transformed into a deadly wasteland teeming with high radiation and bizarre monsters. This forbidden zone has long been uninhabitable for humans.\n\nThe story centers on Leon, a man framed for a crime he didn't commit, torn away from his wife and child, and sent to death row. To survive, he is forced to take on a highly classified, perilous mission with only two outcomes: success or death.\n\nIn the heart of this lethal territory, Leon encounters a variety of strange creatures—from a mysterious young girl to colossal beasts—that will forever change his fate.\n\n(Source: MAL News)",
